@startuml unit_2_overview

' Overview of the `static` view of unit_2: namespaces and the relationship.
' All classes are references (no body); `Bar` is elaborated in
' unit_2_class_diagram.puml, `Foo` is owned and elaborated by unit_1.

namespace safety_software_seooc_example {
    namespace component_example {
        namespace unit_1 {
            class Foo <<final>>
        }

        namespace unit_2 {
            class Bar <<final>>
        }
    }
}

Bar --> Foo : uses

@enduml
